# Checked out from Windows as well as WSL. Normalise to LF in the repo and on
# disk, so a file touched by a Windows editor does not come back as a whole-file
# diff. The Living Worlds scene JSON is data, not source, but it is text too.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, and large. Never diffed, never normalised.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.db binary
